@startuml
!theme reddress-lightgreen
title Greenhouse CO2 Controller - Task Diagram

left to right direction

component "Shell Task" as SHELL
component "Network Task" as NET
component "Sensor / I/O Task" as IO
component "Button Tasks" as BUTTON
component "UI Task" as UI
component "CO2 Controller Task" as CTRL

note left of SHELL
- UART command interface
- Read and change settings
- Quick system configuration
end note

note left of NET
- Wi-Fi connection
- ThingSpeak communication
- Remote commands
end note

note left of IO
- Read CO2 sensor
- Read temperature
- Read humidity
- Read fan feedback
end note

note left of BUTTON
- Read push buttons
- Detect button presses
- Send button events to UI
end note

note left of UI
- Handle local user interface
- Handle menus
- Update OLED
- Change CO2 setpoint
end note

note left of CTRL
- Maintain CO2 setpoint
- Control CO2 valve
- Control ventilation
- Handle safety limit
end note

@enduml